WEBVTT

00:01:37.530 --> 00:01:41.150
Doctor, if the Cabernet 
continues in that direction...

00:01:41.150 --> 00:01:44.290
Yes... The artificial sun will fall...

00:01:44.290 --> 00:01:46.660
The world will lose all light!

00:01:48.040 --> 00:01:51.560
T-The world will lose its light?

00:01:52.430 --> 00:01:53.750
If that happens...

00:01:53.750 --> 00:01:56.380
Dear, what's gonna happen?

00:01:56.380 --> 00:01:58.300
D-Don't ask me!

00:02:00.040 --> 00:02:00.990
Brother...

00:02:01.550 --> 00:02:02.470
Lag...

00:02:03.130 --> 00:02:07.930
Light of Heart

00:02:04.850 --> 00:02:06.100
Noir...

00:02:06.710 --> 00:02:07.840
Noir!

00:02:08.350 --> 00:02:10.070
Noir!

00:02:10.070 --> 00:02:12.780
Hang in there, Noir!

00:02:12.780 --> 00:02:13.840
Noir...

00:02:18.770 --> 00:02:19.740
Noir?

00:02:20.500 --> 00:02:22.910
Lag Seeing...

00:02:23.700 --> 00:02:26.250
Why are you still here?

00:02:27.470 --> 00:02:29.980
Didn't you say?

00:02:29.980 --> 00:02:37.800
That you were going to take the despair that 
the Cabernet was bringing and turn it into hope?

00:02:39.990 --> 00:02:44.930
And besides... Someone 
precious to you is there...

00:02:48.340 --> 00:02:49.780
Mother...

00:02:51.270 --> 00:02:56.500
Now, the thing you must do is...

00:03:02.240 --> 00:03:03.240
Noir...

00:03:12.300 --> 00:03:13.520
Noir?

00:03:13.520 --> 00:03:14.960
Noir!

00:03:16.550 --> 00:03:18.060
Noir...?

00:03:41.570 --> 00:03:42.780
Noir...

00:03:43.370 --> 00:03:44.530
I promise.

00:03:45.110 --> 00:03:52.300
I'll deliver it... To 
everyone... To my mother...

00:03:52.890 --> 00:03:54.540
I'll deliver that hope!

00:03:55.020 --> 00:03:57.380
I have a favor to ask!

00:04:17.090 --> 00:04:17.810
Lag!

00:04:24.400 --> 00:04:27.630
That light... It's just like back then!

00:04:27.630 --> 00:04:28.710
It's the same!

00:04:28.980 --> 00:04:32.370
The time the Cabernet came 
back at Angel's Wing!

00:04:35.710 --> 00:04:37.400
That shining light...

00:04:37.840 --> 00:04:39.410
I think that's Lag!

00:04:40.920 --> 00:04:43.440
He's almost like the artificial sun!

00:04:44.110 --> 00:04:45.680
That little...

00:04:46.170 --> 00:04:47.570
Can you sense it?

00:04:47.570 --> 00:04:48.510
Yes...

00:04:49.440 --> 00:04:53.430
As I thought... Lag is 
simply in human form...

00:05:02.290 --> 00:05:03.230
Lag...

00:05:04.990 --> 00:05:06.470
It's coming back!

00:05:14.230 --> 00:05:17.430
It's coming back, drawn by Lag's light!

00:05:17.430 --> 00:05:19.040
Lag, it's coming!

00:05:34.650 --> 00:05:35.680
Resound!

00:05:37.270 --> 00:05:38.520
Heart!

00:06:35.450 --> 00:06:36.840
You got it!

00:06:36.840 --> 00:06:38.100
Alright!

00:06:38.100 --> 00:06:40.090
You did it, Lag!

00:06:50.000 --> 00:06:51.090
Lag...

00:06:55.660 --> 00:06:59.930
I did it... I did it, Noir...

00:07:36.300 --> 00:07:37.010
Lag!

00:07:41.570 --> 00:07:42.910
Sylvette?

00:07:42.910 --> 00:07:44.780
Lag, are you awake?

00:07:45.750 --> 00:07:47.100
Niche...

00:07:53.690 --> 00:07:55.830
Lag, are you okay?

00:07:57.200 --> 00:07:57.530
Yeah.

00:07:57.530 --> 00:07:59.750
Thank goodness!

00:07:59.750 --> 00:08:02.980
You just wouldn't wake up, so...

00:08:03.440 --> 00:08:04.370
I...

00:08:11.590 --> 00:08:13.370
Noir?!

00:08:13.370 --> 00:08:16.380
You're okay? I really thought you'd...

00:08:18.510 --> 00:08:19.810
Thank goodness...

00:08:23.010 --> 00:08:23.560
Lag.

00:08:24.840 --> 00:08:29.490
I am going to live with the ones 
who were unable to become spirit.

00:08:31.460 --> 00:08:32.940
You're leaving?

00:08:38.460 --> 00:08:40.790
Thank you, Lag Seeing.

00:08:41.730 --> 00:08:48.080
I had lost my heart. If I had not met you, I 
would never have found my new path in life.

00:08:50.470 --> 00:08:52.660
No, I'm the one who should thank you.

00:08:53.020 --> 00:08:57.750
The reason I wanted to become a Letter 
Bee is because I met you back then.

00:08:58.380 --> 00:09:01.320
If I hadn't become a Letter Bee,

00:09:01.600 --> 00:09:06.770
I would have never met Niche, 
or Sylvette, or everyone else.

00:09:17.660 --> 00:09:20.740
So, we'll never see each other again?

00:09:22.070 --> 00:09:23.370
That is not the case.

00:09:38.830 --> 00:09:41.430
We are friends, yes?

00:09:43.580 --> 00:09:46.100
Fri...ends?

00:09:47.100 --> 00:09:47.980
Yes.

00:09:51.020 --> 00:09:52.990
Friends...

00:09:58.350 --> 00:09:59.940
Noir...

00:10:01.560 --> 00:10:08.360
I'm so glad... that I met you...

00:10:13.280 --> 00:10:15.950
Farewell, Gauche.

00:10:15.950 --> 00:10:18.220
Stay well, Brother.

00:10:29.280 --> 00:10:31.280
Goodbye!

00:10:31.720 --> 00:10:34.940
Goodbye, Brother!

00:10:34.940 --> 00:10:39.320
Goodbye, Noir!

00:10:39.320 --> 00:10:41.700
Goodbye!

00:10:45.030 --> 00:10:47.390
Thank you, Lag Seeing.

00:10:47.890 --> 00:10:51.920
Goodbye, my friend.

00:10:56.720 --> 00:11:03.330
Goodbye, Noir, Roda...

00:11:04.680 --> 00:11:05.880
Lag!

00:11:06.430 --> 00:11:07.470
Yes?

00:11:08.140 --> 00:11:09.480
Take care of my sister.

00:11:12.510 --> 00:11:13.480
Understood!

00:11:25.880 --> 00:11:30.000
Goodbye, Sister!

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:31.930
Goodbye!

00:11:35.750 --> 00:11:40.560
Let's disappear before anyone from 
the government finds us, Hazle.

00:11:40.560 --> 00:11:43.940
Sure. But what'll we do now?

00:11:43.940 --> 00:11:45.090
I don't know.

00:11:45.090 --> 00:11:46.530
You don't know?

00:11:46.530 --> 00:11:51.480
All I know is that our days 
as Marauders are over.

00:11:54.100 --> 00:11:55.150
Ain't that the truth?

00:12:21.010 --> 00:12:22.210
Pardon me.

00:12:27.310 --> 00:12:28.220
Master?

00:12:29.960 --> 00:12:31.270
Master!

00:12:39.080 --> 00:12:39.980
Aria-kun!

00:12:39.980 --> 00:12:44.350
The Day I Saw the Maka 
recounted by Vincent Alcott...

00:12:44.350 --> 00:12:45.950
I haven't heard that name before.

00:12:46.270 --> 00:12:48.740
But it's the top-seller recently.

00:12:49.000 --> 00:12:51.370
It's a record of what happened that day.

00:12:55.300 --> 00:12:57.700
So, you needed me for something?

00:12:57.700 --> 00:12:59.380
Oh, right.

00:12:59.880 --> 00:13:01.480
A letter for you, Master.

00:13:01.480 --> 00:13:02.710
For me?

00:13:04.130 --> 00:13:06.590
Oh, it's from Jiggy Pepper.

00:13:12.000 --> 00:13:17.030
As long as heart shines, hope 
will shine again. Isn't that so?

00:13:17.750 --> 00:13:18.780
Let's go.

00:13:28.180 --> 00:13:32.310
It sounds like they went to 
live in Blue Notes Blues.

00:13:33.050 --> 00:13:35.980
Are you referring to the ones that 
were unable to become spirit?

00:13:35.980 --> 00:13:36.660
Yup.

00:13:36.900 --> 00:13:42.170
All they need to do now is wait for Dr. 
Thunderland's research to be finished.

00:13:43.200 --> 00:13:46.470
Returning a lost heart, huh?

00:13:50.550 --> 00:13:53.470
Work hard today? Let's go home, Hunt...

00:13:53.470 --> 00:13:56.140
Sarah, go home without me.

00:13:56.450 --> 00:13:58.410
I'd like to continue work a little longer.

00:13:59.050 --> 00:14:01.110
Don't overdo it now.

00:14:01.110 --> 00:14:06.990
I'm not. All I want is to complete 
this research as soon as possible.

00:14:09.000 --> 00:14:12.120
Sarah's right. Go home for today.

00:14:12.610 --> 00:14:13.670
Doctor?

00:14:14.300 --> 00:14:15.740
Doctor, Hunt just...

00:14:16.360 --> 00:14:20.290
I mean... We just want to be of help.

00:14:20.590 --> 00:14:21.990
To correct past mistakes.

00:14:21.990 --> 00:14:26.000
And you can't do that if you 
neglect your own health.

00:14:26.300 --> 00:14:28.010
Don't make Sarah worry.

00:14:29.520 --> 00:14:32.380
These are Doctor's orders.

00:14:34.060 --> 00:14:34.600
Yes, Doctor.

00:14:39.450 --> 00:14:40.820
Good timing.

00:14:43.550 --> 00:14:44.650
Sunny...

00:14:44.650 --> 00:14:47.690
Dr. Thunderland, I've 
finished baking the cookies!

00:14:47.690 --> 00:14:49.840
Oh, thank you, Sunny.

00:14:51.610 --> 00:14:55.750
Doctor! It's bad manners not 
to wash your hands first!

00:14:55.750 --> 00:14:56.490
Delicious!

00:14:58.880 --> 00:15:02.850
She still can't remember who she is, right?

00:15:02.850 --> 00:15:08.040
But once Dr. Thunderland's research is 
complete, she'll be able to, for sure.

00:15:08.410 --> 00:15:09.260
Yup!

00:15:09.520 --> 00:15:11.050
I gotta work hard!

00:15:12.340 --> 00:15:15.440
What's that for all of a sudden?

00:15:15.440 --> 00:15:17.510
Well, 'cause I got a special someone now.

00:15:18.140 --> 00:15:20.000
A special someone?

00:15:20.000 --> 00:15:20.770
Who?

00:15:23.230 --> 00:15:26.030
You don't mean... Sunny?

00:15:27.570 --> 00:15:30.580
I see. I'm the same way.

00:15:31.510 --> 00:15:33.450
Every one of 'em is precious to me.

00:15:37.910 --> 00:15:40.540
She gave birth again, after all...

00:15:41.760 --> 00:15:44.750
We both gotta work hard just the same.

00:15:45.280 --> 00:15:48.940
Well, my delivery is to the Pliocena Coast.

00:15:49.630 --> 00:15:51.270
Take care!

00:15:52.470 --> 00:15:53.680
Same to you!

00:15:53.680 --> 00:15:57.220
Don't walk off a cliff while 
your head's in the clouds!

00:16:01.950 --> 00:16:04.540
Guess we should go too, Gus.

00:16:10.860 --> 00:16:15.260
I never would have expected our 
aid to Reverse to be overlooked,

00:16:15.260 --> 00:16:18.430
and us to be returned to work at the Bifrost.

00:16:18.690 --> 00:16:20.750
It's thanks to Largo's efforts.

00:16:20.750 --> 00:16:21.660
Yes...

00:16:22.300 --> 00:16:25.920
What did you think of the 
light we felt back then?

00:16:32.830 --> 00:16:35.850
But, it's written right here on this page.

00:16:36.920 --> 00:16:38.180
The distant past...

00:16:38.830 --> 00:16:44.940
Perhaps this is what the world was like, 
before the artificial sun was necessary?

00:16:44.940 --> 00:16:46.830
But, that's...

00:16:46.830 --> 00:16:50.150
Nothing more than the author's fantasy.

00:16:51.010 --> 00:16:53.900
But we should have seen 
it that day as well...

00:16:58.380 --> 00:16:59.910
The Light of Heart.

00:17:02.170 --> 00:17:04.960
If what Caribs Garrard says is the truth,

00:17:05.590 --> 00:17:09.960
the artificial sun shines 
using the people's sadness.

00:17:10.570 --> 00:17:12.110
But that's not it.

00:17:12.580 --> 00:17:14.870
If, perhaps, light can 
shine down on the world

00:17:14.870 --> 00:17:17.750
from someone with a strong 
feeling in their heart...

00:17:22.550 --> 00:17:24.370
Here, some lunch!

00:17:24.370 --> 00:17:27.410
I changed up the flavor a little from usual!

00:17:27.410 --> 00:17:28.620
I'm quite confident in this one!

00:17:28.620 --> 00:17:31.150
Uh, thanks, Sylvette...

00:17:35.380 --> 00:17:36.960
I'm heading out!

00:17:37.280 --> 00:17:38.910
See you later!

00:17:43.530 --> 00:17:48.600
Well, that being said, he's 
still the same as ever.

00:17:48.600 --> 00:17:51.420
Yes. He headed out on a delivery today.

00:17:51.910 --> 00:17:54.670
Because that is the job of a Letter Bee.

00:18:05.180 --> 00:18:07.730
I miss him so...

00:18:10.100 --> 00:18:13.030
If I could deliver...

00:18:14.720 --> 00:18:19.850
If I could at least deliver 
your heart to Lag Seeing...

00:18:24.420 --> 00:18:28.070
You delivered my mother's heart to me...

00:18:29.000 --> 00:18:30.930
I'll never forget that.

00:18:32.030 --> 00:18:33.030
Lag!

00:18:34.000 --> 00:18:35.940
I can see the city!

00:18:38.190 --> 00:18:40.300
Right! Let's hurry!

00:18:47.370 --> 00:18:52.270
But for right now, I'm 
still... Though, one day...

00:19:08.760 --> 00:19:10.040
Good day!

00:19:11.070 --> 00:19:12.410
Delivery for you!

00:19:12.410 --> 00:19:14.250
I've come to deliver you a letter!
